# The template of .env.test: the settings of the tests, which win over .env's (the tests read .env.test, then .env,
# but not .env.local). bin/setup copies it to .env.test, which git ignores; change your copy, not this committed file,
# and put no secrets here. CI uses .env.ci in its place.

# The PostgreSQL login of opencourts_test, which otvorenesudy-api's tests share. It has to be a superuser: bin/test
# recreates the database, and a spec restores a dump with its roles. Left empty, PostgreSQL's defaults apply: your own
# user on localhost, a superuser on Homebrew's PostgreSQL. Empty values here keep a login set in .env out of the tests.
OPENCOURTS_DATABASE_USER=
OPENCOURTS_DATABASE_PASSWORD=
